CORE
main.c
--k-induction --multi-property --max-k-step 5
^Unable to prove or falsify the program, giving up\.$
^VERIFICATION UNKNOWN$
^\s+UNKNOWN\s+\[main\.assertion\.1\]\s+line\s+10\s+assertion x != 100 \(inductive step could not prove this claim\)$
^\*\* 0 of 1 properties failed, 1 unknown$
\A(?![\s\S]*VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL)[\s\S]*\Z
